Downstream-Reason: Under Set ClickLead, draw a ring that spreads from where a click was sent and fades over 520 ms, so a click reads at GIF frame rates.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream evp draws a spreading ripple for a drawn click.
